{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（25日）早上7時53分，將軍澳工業邨駿宏街巴士總站有一輛九巴車尾冒煙。據了解，巴士當時並無載客，車長泊車後離開，未幾有煙冒出。</p><p>消防員接報到場將火救熄，事件中無人受傷，毋須疏散，火警起因有待調查。</p><figure><img alt=\"火警中無人受傷。（黃偉民攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260925/1180077362956734464039725.jpeg/IOK6Ni_09nJcz9L5FxZiO9G83ZDAxfCbpA-oMI4PqDA\"/><figcaption>火警中無人受傷。（黃偉民攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"巴士車尾冒煙，由消防救熄。（黃偉民攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260925/1180077360179974144125687.jpeg/yJ7PPB2Wb7C1qgNFqvrojGTYAOs_3GD_foSbN1SEmzc\"/><figcaption>巴士車尾冒煙，由消防救熄。（黃偉民攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"巴士車尾冒煙，由消防救熄。（黃偉民攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260925/1180077357201887232584619.jpeg/cqG-VVyTUkmCminpy3ADvjmMU1ypoj1ZLrDz5wSw8-c\"/><figcaption>巴士車尾冒煙，由消防救熄。（黃偉民攝）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-25T00:59:18.485177+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":156,"images":3,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none"}}